# Cursor rules

Read `AGENTS.md` and `CODEBASE_ARCHITECTURE.md` first, they are the source of
truth for commands, conventions, and architecture.

## Observability

Do NOT wrap server functions (`createServerFn`) in Sentry tracing spans.
Server instrumentation was intentionally trimmed for edge-cacheability and
fast cold starts. Sentry runs client-side (lazy, `src/router.tsx`) and via
`instrument.server.mjs` only (prod-only, no OTel auto-instrumentation).

## Convex

The real schema is `conversations` / `messages` / `messageParts`
(`convex/schema.ts`). Better Auth tables live in the betterAuth component
(`convex/betterAuth/schema.ts`, generated, never edit). For Convex value types
see https://docs.convex.dev/database/types .

## shadcn

Add components with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>`.
